	<string># Web Capture

Turn the current page or a URL into Markdown, a full-page screenshot, a code image, or a YouTube transcript.

&gt; **Status:** planned — not yet functional. See [PLAN.md](PLAN.md).

## Usage

Turn the current page or a URL into Markdown, a full-page screenshot, a code image, or a YouTube transcript via the `tomd` keyword.

![Web Capture results in Alfred](images/tomd.png)

* &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Primary action.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Secondary action.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;Y&lt;/kbd&gt; Quick Look.

Every keyword can be changed in the Workflow’s Configuration.

## Development

```bash
./build.sh   # -&gt; dist/alfred-web-capture-&lt;version&gt;.alfredworkflow
```

## AI disclosure

This workflow is developed with the help of Claude (Anthropic), an AI assistant. All code is reviewed and tested by the author.
